'''Harbinger of Brutality''' is a [[spell]] that summons an allied Harbinger [[minion]]. The skill is only available through {{il|The Enmity Divine}}.

==Skill Functions and Interactions==
The summoned Harbinger is immortal, and will occasionally apply the ''The Enmity Divine'' [[buff]] on the player. ''The Enmity Divine'' lasts 8 seconds, with a cooldown of 20 seconds, and grants the following benefits:
* 50% increased Damage
* 15% Damage Reduction
* 30% increased Attack Speed
* 30% increased Movement Speed

==Drop restrictions==
Harbinger of Brutality can only be obtained by equipping {{il|The Enmity Divine}}.

